{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中式帆船鴨靈號與嗇色園合作，將主帆換上黃大仙像，即日起在維港巡航。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鑼鼓聲一響，鴨靈號的主帆緩緩拉起，展出黃大仙像，前帆就印有求籤筒的圖案。嗇色園監院李耀輝主持儀式，包括上香、開光、誦經等，祈求家國繁榮、社會和諧。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_CC.J.WTS-1930.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026J3vkhAbgey1790174458.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_CC.J.WTS-1930.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鴨靈號之後起航，在維港展開為期兩周的巡遊，慶祝國慶77周年，以及黃大仙寶誕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_CC.J.WTS-1930_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ZRG5aCbM0J1790174442.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_CC.J.WTS-1930_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">嗇色園主席黎澤森<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>說：「</span>向全世界生動展示黃大仙信俗這項國家級非物質文化遺產，為大眾帶來獨一無二的文旅體驗。<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_CC.J.WTS-1930_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026rwdRYFstEX1790174512.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_CC.J.WTS-1930_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">揚帆禮吸引不少善信和遊客參與<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">上海旅客任先生<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>指出：「</span>趕上這個黃大仙的法事，因為我們也特別虔誠，我們也經常拜黃大仙，正好趕上我們的國慶，希望香港越來越繁榮、昌盛<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">墨西哥旅客Susy<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>表示：「</span>我經過時看到了這個，就想看看這是甚麼<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>。</span>我肯定會再來香港的<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_CC.J.WTS-1930_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263L2ZHaQ7h61790174547.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_CC.J.WTS-1930_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主辦方又推出以聚寶盆、求籤筒等造型的文創產品，開拓年輕人的市場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T14:58:53.011682+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}